    "tools/image_gen_tools.py; and, for MCP tools matched by their short name",
    "(mcp__<server>__<short_name>), packages/aria_mcp/bridge.py and the",
    "research-run tools listed in ollama_stream.py. Fully-qualified",
    "mcp__<server>__<tool> names are accepted without being listed here.",
    "Update this file when aria-code adds or renames a tool."
